            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Cove 0.1.44</title></head><body><h1>A clearer email reader</h1><ul><li>More thoughtful spacing, labeled toolbar actions, and clearer sender details.</li><li>Jev’s assessment and source excerpts sit apart from the original email.</li><li>Reply, Forward, and Ask Cove stay within reach as you scroll.</li><li>Choose Formatted or Text only, flag an email for follow-up, set a local reminder, or prepare a translation request in Ask Cove.</li><li>Controls and long sender details adapt to narrow reading panes.</li></ul></body></html>
]]></description>
