            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Cove 0.1.43</title></head><body><h1>A clearer, more consistent Cove</h1><ul><li>Consistent titles, labels, and supporting text across Home, Mail, Calendar, Contacts, Agents, chat, Settings, and Integrations.</li><li>Compact settings copy and Cove’s outlined action buttons give each section more breathing room.</li><li>Compose and AI suggestions now share the same reading size and line spacing.</li><li>Clearer small calendar text and invitation buttons that fit narrow panes.</li></ul></body></html>]]></description>
